#ASSERT `Can this person be my attorney` `another body corporate` `for fin` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: only an individual, a trustee company or the Public Advocate is eligible (ss 22(4), 28)`

