§§ `Part 5 -- whether my power is in force, and revoking it`

-- Arguments: by its terms, I died, declared invalid, I revoked, later power, VCAT revoked, attorney died, attorney lost
-- capacity, disqualified, company wound up, resigned, suspended.
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `in force`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: it is revoked according to its terms (s 43)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: it is revoked by my death (s 51)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: VCAT has declared it invalid; it is void from its commencement (s 119)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: I revoked it, or this attorney's appointment (s 44)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: revoked by my later enduring power of attorney (s 55)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: VCAT revoked it, or this attorney's appointment (s 120(1)(a), (b))`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: revoked as to this attorney, who has died (s 52)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: revoked as to this attorney, who has lost decision making capacity for the matters (s 53)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: revoked as to this attorney, who became insolvent, my care worker, health provider or accommodation provider, or (for financial matters) was convicted of dishonesty, after appointment (s 54(1))`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: revoked as to this trustee company, which was wound up or ceased to be registered (s 54(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no: revoked as to this attorney, who resigned (ss 56, 59)`
#ASSERT `Is my power still in force` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `suspended by VCAT for a specified period (s 120(1)(d))`

